Text_SeismicTossTeach::
    .string "The secrets of space…\n"
    .string "The mysteries of earth…\p"
    .string "There are so many things about\n"
    .string "which we know so little.\p"
    .string "But that should spur us to study\n"
    .string "harder, not toss in the towel.\p"
    .string "The only thing you should toss…\p"
    .string "Well, how about SEISMIC TOSS?\n"
    .string "Should I teach that to a POKéMON?$"

Text_SeismicTossDeclined::
    .string "Is that so?\n"
    .string "I'm sure you'll be back for it.$"

Text_SeismicTossWhichMon::
    .string "Which POKéMON wants to learn\n"
    .string "SEISMIC TOSS?$"

Text_SeismicTossTaught::
    .string "I hope you won't toss in the towel.\n"
    .string "Keep it up.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone::
    .string "That case held the PYROPE.\n"
    .string "Deep red, warm to the touch.\p"
    .string "Gone in one night, and not a\n"
    .string "single alarm went off.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding::
    .string "July 20, 1969!\p"
    .string "Humankind first set foot on the\n"
    .string "moon that day.\p"
    .string "I bought a color TV just so I\n"
    .string "could watch that news.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth::
    .string "The PYROPE hummed whenever a\n"
    .string "POKéMON's AURA came near.\p"
    .string "The thieves left only a note.\n"
    .string "We called the police at dawn.$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu::
    .string "I want a PIKACHU!\n"
    .string "It's so cute!\p"
    .string "I asked my daddy to catch me one!$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise::
    .string "Yeah, a PIKACHU soon, I promise!$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle::
    .string "Space Shuttle$"

PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon::
    .string "The display case is empty. A note\n"
    .string "is left behind: POKéMON were never\p"
    .string "meant to be owned. - TEAM ONYBRIS$"


PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_BrockBeforeKay::
    .string "BROCK: I was GYM LEADER here until\n"
    .string "the AURA changed everything.\p"
    .string "KAY holds the GYM now. I look after\n"
    .string "this MUSEUM instead.\p"
    .string "Last night they took the PYROPE.\n"
    .string "One of them beat me. Me!\p"
    .string "...That pendant around your neck.\n"
    .string "It hums like the PYROPE did.\p"
    .string "Keep it close, kid.\p"
    .string "Every town keeps a gem, and TEAM\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS is collecting them.\p"
    .string "The next one sleeps in TOURMALIA.\n"
    .string "But first, go see KAY at the GYM.$"

PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_BrockAfterKay::
    .string "BROCK: So you beat KAY. Good.\n"
    .string "She always burned too bright.\p"
    .string "I'll stay and watch the MUSEUM.\n"
    .string "They may come back.\p"
    .string "Go on to TOURMALIA, {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "The next gem sleeps there.$"

PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_BrockFossil::
    .string "BROCK: CHAMPION! The whole museum\n"
    .string "heard the news.\p"
    .string "A piece of the past should live\n"
    .string "again. This one was stored in the\l"
    .string "vault. It is yours.$"

PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_BrockFossilAfter::
    .string "BROCK: Have it revived at the\n"
    .string "lab on CINNABAR. Bring it back to\l"
    .string "the world, as it should be.$"

PewterCity_Museum_2F_Text_MonSlowpoke::
    .string "SLOWPOKE: ...Yawn.\nIt basks in the glow of the lava.$"
